 "remarks": "Whether you're seeking a seasonal retreat, a stylish home during a renovation or a refreshing getaway from city life, this beautifully updated circa 1880 Greens Farms Colonial farmhouse offers the ideal blend of historic charm, modern comfort, and effortless coastal living.  Featuring a stunning renovated white kitchen and updated baths, 9-foot ceilings on the main level, and wide-plank wood floors throughout, the home radiates warmth and character. Enjoy inviting living spaces, including a comfortable living room and large sun-filled family room. A versatile main-level bonus room offers the flexibility of a home office, playroom, or fourth bedroom, while three additional bedrooms are located upstairs. A gracious front porch with its classic bench swing invites you to slow down and unwind. Lovely grounds and a detached oversized two-car garage complete the picture.  Ideally situated in desirable Greens Farms, just a short walk to the beach and train, this special home offers an exceptional combination of charm, convenience, and the quintessential Westport lifestyle.",
